      "side": 1,
      "message": "Isn\u0027t it atomic_and in Zephyr APIs?\n\nWhat\u0027s the value in renaming the deprecated APIs to be named a little closer to Zephyr APIs? Our goal is just to get rid of all the deprecated_* functions anyway...",
